      "created_at": "2016-07-10T15:43:29Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-07-10T15:44:03Z",
      "body": "I have given this suggestion a bit more thought. In all fairness, I don't think we can implement this without cloud based storage. Phones live 2-3 years (with probably one or two full factory resets in that time frame); degradation to 75% for a ZOE is expected in the rough order of 200.000 kilometers, which is much more than the lifespan of the device.\n\nGiven the reluctance to implement and also maintain ANYTHING with remote data, partly because of Luxembourg and German legislation, I think this might be something we need to let go.\n\n@fesch what do you think?\n",
      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "pin": null,
