      "created_at": "2016-07-10T17:14:30Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-07-10T17:14:30Z",
      "body": "You are right: As soon as we make our app \"connected\", we will get a rather large tail of constraints to handle to make this \"the right way\".\n\nAlthough any user must upload his data 100% willingly I think that the stored data itself will need some extra protection we could hardly guarantee. And then, as you already mentioned, we would need to ask to be allowed to handle such a database ... to be 100% legally ...\n",
